 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Strategy Digital Strategy Experts D3 is a renowned digital marketing agency that has stood the test of time for the past 30 years, rolling with the growth and changes that came with the internet, online services, digital marketing, and now artificial intelligence. Our local team is experts in digital strategy and will make sure you see results. What Makes an Effective Marketing Strategy? Your marketing strategy is a blueprint for all of your marketing efforts. This plan of action should define your objectives, audiences, and goals that can be measured for success. Without it, campaigns can feel scattered, budgets get wasted, and opportunities are missed. No matter your company’s size or industry, you deserve a strategy that fits. How D3 Can Help With Strategy Market Research Learn who your customers and competitors are. Brand Positioning Emphasize what makes your business unique and communicate it effectively. Channel Planning Find the right balance between marketing channels. Content Strategy Map out content that will shine on your platforms. Analytics & Optimization Review performance data and tweak for stronger results. Since digital marketing is continually evolving with new tools and trends, what worked for your marketing strategy in the past may no longer be as effective today. Partner with D3 to make sure your plan is sound. Case Studies Expert Digital Marketing Strategy That Delivers WHITE MARLIN OPEN White Marlin Open has been a valued client of D3 since 2016, with nearly a decade of ongoing collaboration. Each year, D3 partners closely with the WMO team to deliver a seamless digital experience for participants and spectators throughout the tournament, from pre-event to post-event. VIEW CASE STUDY BOARDWALK HOTEL GROUP Building on a long-standing relationship, D3 led a comprehensive overhaul of Boardwalk Hotel Group’s four websites, refreshing photography and video, restructuring and streamlining extensive content, and updating design to better meet evolving guest expectations. The project showcased our project management strength and expertise while integrating seamlessly with ongoing marketing efforts to ensure cohesion across all initiatives. The result is a modern, unified website experience that maintains strong search performance, aligns with industry standards, and continues to drive... VIEW CASE STUDY JOLLY ROGER AMUSEMENTS A familiar legend, newly charted: D3 reimagined Jolly Roger® Amusement Parks, a beloved Ocean City, MD brand, for a new generation of visitors. Over the years, Jolly Roger’s digital presence had expanded across multiple sister websites representing all of its parks and attractions. We envisioned a solution to reduce complexity from both a management and maintenance perspective, and to modernize the famed amusement park’s brand presence. VIEW CASE STUDY CASTLE IN THE SAND HOTEL The Castle in the Sand Hotel has been an iconic Ocean City, MD destination for generations. Owned and operated by the Showell family, the hotel is known for its stunning oceanfront location, close to all the action, its variety of accommodations, and its family-friendly atmosphere. VIEW CASE STUDY VISITING ANGELS® EASTERN SHORE, MD When Visiting Angels consolidated three Eastern Shore offices under one brand, they needed a localized SEO strategy that could compete with both their franchise network and regional competitors. D3 implemented a localized SEO and AEO strategy that included localized landing pages, enhanced service descriptions, structured FAQs, and optimized Google My Business Profiles. D3’s work doubled the number of caregivers and clients, drove measurable growth in organic website traffic, search rankings, referrals, and caregiver applications. VIEW CASE STUDY OLD PRO GOLF Old Pro Golf has been delighting families in Ocean City, MD, since 1963. D3 helped bring their iconic courses into the modern era with a refreshed brand, vibrant photography, a dynamic new website, and playful social storytelling. From immersive course visuals to an online scorecard and streamlined event booking, every touchpoint celebrates nostalgia while engaging a new generation of mini-golfers. VIEW CASE STUDY ZEN SPA & STUDIO Z Zen Spa, nestled along the coast of Delaware, offers a peaceful escape from daily life with a wide array of services dedicated to rejuvenation and wellness for both locals and visitors to the area. The spa specializes in personalized massage therapies, advanced skincare treatments, and restorative body treatments that combine traditional techniques with modern wellness practices. With a focus on holistic health and a serene ambiance, Zen Spa provides a sanctuary where guests can relax, recharge, and... VIEW CASE STUDY 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 Develop an Informed and Innovative Plan With D3’s Digital Marketing Experts Submit the form below, or give us a call at 410-213-2400 First Name Last Name Company Name Phone Email How Did You Hear About D3? How Did You Hear About D3?* Google Search Social Media Word of Mouth Referral from a Friend or Colleague Event or Trade Show Walk-In / Drove By Print Advertisement Email Newsletter From Another Business Existing Client I'm Interested in the following Services: This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. SUBMIT Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design by D3, Ocean City MD Our Partners PREVIOUS Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google NEXT",
